{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42764","headline":"江楼望乡寄内 · 刘兼","name":"江楼望乡寄内","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独上江楼望故乡，泪襟霜笛共凄凉。\n云生陇首秋虽早，月在天心夜已长。\n魂梦只能随蛱蝶，烟波无计学鸳鸯。\n蜀笺都有三千幅，总写离情寄孟光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}